{"id":"07d803337c0e6ed3","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-minimal-surface.md","title":"Minimal Surface","display":"df-minimal-surface — Minimal Surface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-minimal-surface","aliases":["58-df-minimal-surface"],"display":"df-minimal-surface — Minimal Surface","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-immersion.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-minimal-surface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-minimal-surface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-surface — Minimal Surface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7056a4392f2b25e2\" href=\"?note=7056a4392f2b25e2\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-immersion.md\">../batch08/58-df-immersion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,F,\\Sigma,g_F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\\in V\">\\(M,F,\\Sigma,g_F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}},\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathbb R^3\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathbb R^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7056a4392f2b25e2\" href=\"?note=7056a4392f2b25e2\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-immersion.md\">../batch08/58-df-immersion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{MinimalSurface}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{MinimalSurface}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PullbackMetric},\\operatorname{LaplaceBeltrami}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{PullbackMetric},\\operatorname{LaplaceBeltrami}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (local operators used below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,D,T_M,T_{\\mathbb R^3}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,2)\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3,D,T_M,T_{\\mathbb R^3})\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,F[M],\\{U\\cap F[M]:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\\})\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,D,T_M,T_{\\mathbb R^3}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,2)\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3,D,T_M,T_{\\mathbb R^3})\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,F[M],\\{U\\cap F[M]:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\\})\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}metric} \\vdash g_F\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PullbackMetric}(F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}metric} \\vdash g_F\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PullbackMetric}(F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinimalSurface}_S(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,F,g_F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Sigma=F[M]\n\\land g_F=\\operatorname{PullbackMetric}(F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\n\\land\\operatorname{LaplaceBeltrami}(g_F,F)=0\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}surface\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinimalSurface}_S(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,F,g_F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothEmbedding}_S(F,M,\\mathbb R^3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Sigma=F[M]\n\\land g_F=\\operatorname{PullbackMetric}(F,g_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\n\\land\\operatorname{LaplaceBeltrami}(g_F,F)=0\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The induced metric is now bound inside the unary predicate instead of occurring as a hidden free parameter.  The equivalent mean-curvature characterization is a derived theorem, not a second defining clause with an unbound curvature field.</li>\n<li>Douglas–Rado (1931): least-area disk spanning a wire.</li>\n<li>Complete minimal surfaces: Jenkins–Serrin (1962).</li>\n<li>The Costa surface is a complete embedded finite-total-curvature minimal surface of genus one with three ends.</li>\n<li>Nadirashvili (1996) constructed a complete bounded immersed minimal surface in a ball.</li>\n<li>The source supplies a six-place immersion-data predicate and a five-place homeomorphism predicate. Both are now called at those exact arities, with the domain topology and image subspace topology bound inside the embedding predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi